<%- include('partials/head') %><%- include('partials/nav') %><section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow light-eyebrow">DEVELOPER REFERENCE</div><h1>Journey Masterz <em>API.</em></h1><p>Versioned public JSON endpoints for published trip content and enquiries.</p></div></section><section class="section wrap api-docs"><h2>Base path: <code>/api/v1</code></h2><p><a class="text-link" href="/openapi.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener">OpenAPI JSON specification ↗</a></p><p>Responses use JSON. Public endpoints expose published content only. Private enquiries and administrator data are not available through public read endpoints.</p><div class="endpoint"><span class="method get">GET</span><code>/packages?q=&region=&category=&page=1&limit=12</code><p>Search and paginate published packages.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><span class="method get">GET</span><code>/packages/:slug</code><p>Read one published package by URL slug.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><span class="method get">GET</span><code>/destinations</code><p>List published destinations.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><span class="method get">GET</span><code>/destinations/:slug</code><p>Read one published destination.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><span class="method get">GET</span><code>/faqs</code><p>List public FAQs.</p></div><div class="endpoint"><span class="method post">POST</span><code>/enquiries</code><p>Submit JSON with <code>name</code> and <code>phone</code> required; optional fields include email, destination, travel_date, travellers and message.</p></div><p class="muted">Production note: add formal OpenAPI generation, CSRF protection for browser-admin forms, backups, monitoring and a managed database before higher-scale deployment.</p></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
